Package: densweave
Type: Package
Title: Density-First Topology Visualization
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Replaces conventional scatter plots with density-terrain quilts, exposing topology, valleys, ridges, and rare-event positions invisible in point clouds.
    Part of the bioviz suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
